<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-TOP SCORER DRULAK SIGNS FOR STRUGGLING FC LINZ.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOP SCORER DRULAK SIGNS FOR STRUGGLING FC LINZ.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veteran striker Radek Drulak, 35, top-scorer in the Czech first division for the past two seasons, has signed from Petra Drnovice for Austrian side FC Linz, who are bottom of the league.</p>
<p>&quot;They (Linz) told me 'It doesn't matter how old you are, we know your talent.' That pleased me,&quot; said Drulak, leading Czech scorer again this season with 13 goals so far.</p>
</text>
